 test_newadd 
-------------
           3
(1 row)

select mysqlt.test_newadd(1, 2, 3); --err
ERROR:  function mysqlt.test_newadd(integer, integer, integer) does not exist
LINE 1: select mysqlt.test_newadd(1, 2, 3);
               ^
